; The Spread's portrait slot — the SAME OrientationSlot script as the
; T-UI-02 foundation (thin scene, no forked components) with the T-UI-03
; run-header strip enabled: pips top rail, stacked spread, chronicle
; bottom, header above the rail.
[gd_scene load_steps=2 format=3]

